I've attached Siobhan's slot map for your check with Japan Finance. Could you=
 ask them to compare the bands on the last page with the regular payment and =
month-end rotas? We have account reconciliation from 14:30 to 16:30 JST on 19=
 March and the variance review from 15:00 to 16:45 JST on 26 March. On both d=
ates the primary and deputy are on close work throughout the usual 15:00=E2=
=80=9316:30 JST window for 07. Please let Siobhan and me know if Japan Financ=
e finds a difference in either assignment or its timing.

